<title>BULGARIA: Deutsche MG to advise Bulgaria on telecom sale.</title>
<headline>Deutsche MG to advise Bulgaria on telecom sale.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell has been chosen to advise Bulgaria on the planned sale of a stake in the Bulgarian Telecommunications Company (BTC), Finance Minister Svetoslav Gavriiski said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Gavriiski told reporters that the IMF had required that Bulgaria appoint a consultant for the sale before the IMF board meets next week to approve a standby accord.</p>
<p>BTC officials say Bulgaria has agreed with the IMF to sell a majority stake in the company.</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom 359-2-84561</p>
</text>
